  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>IOAKU by Fanny Ek is a Scandinavian jewelry brand creating statement pieces designed to be worn every day. Our collections combine artistic expression with timeless design — crafted to elevate personal style and feel like an extension of identity, not just an accessory.</p><hr><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>We don’t follow trends — we create pieces with meaning. IOAKU stands for individuality, quality, and emotional connection. From our signature designs like La Fleur, Berry, and Dragonfly, to our carefully curated packaging experience, every detail is made to feel premium, personal, and memorable.</p><hr><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale generated through their unique link or code. We reward high-performing partners and prioritize long-term collaborations with creators who align with our brand.</p><hr><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>We encourage authentic, aesthetic, and story-driven content. Show how you wear IOAKU in your everyday life — styling, gifting moments, unboxing experiences, or personal stories. Content that feels real and inspiring performs best.</p><hr><p><strong>• Other information:</strong><br>We’re looking to build long-term relationships with creators who genuinely connect with the brand. IOAKU is not about hard selling — it’s about creating desire through identity, emotion, and style.</p></div>",
